WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:03.040
Good morning Hank; it’s Friday. Today’s
video is actually like Voldemort’s soul

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:07.740
because it comes to you in eight parts. It
is also like the cake, because it is, at least

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:11.880
partly, a lie. That’s right, Hank, it’s
April Fool’s Day. One of these eight parts

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:16.960
is a lie. You will either guess the lie or
I will have fooled you, which will make me

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:21.690
the winner of an arbitrary contest of my own
creation! Which is my favorite kind of game

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:22.690
to win.

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:25.490
Part one: Hank, Nerdfighters have done so
much research into the great and terrible

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:30.529
library of Ivan the Terrible that we are now
the largest resource on the entire internet

00:00:30.529 --> 00:00:34.300
on the topic. And the story they’ve uncovered
is crazy, Hank, it involves, like, fire-proof

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:39.930
dungeons and crucified skeletons and a supposedly-blind
architect! It’s like National Treasure only

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:42.960
it’s real and the role of Nicholas Cage
is played by nerds.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:46.350
Speaking of Nicholas Cage, Hank, part two:
Nicholas Cage has a son named Kal-El, like

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:50.510
the birth name of Superman, his name is Kal-El
Coppola Cage because, you know, Nick Cage

00:00:50.510 --> 00:00:54.769
is cousins with Sofia Coppola, who by the
way made The Virgin Suicides into a movie,

00:00:54.769 --> 00:00:58.690
a book written by Jeffrey Eugenides, whose
facial hair may or may not be a joke.

00:00:58.690 --> 00:01:01.839
Part three: also, while we’re on the topic
of celebrities, Michael J. Fox’s middle

00:01:01.839 --> 00:01:03.129
name? Andrew.

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:06.270
Part four: Hank, I hate being one of those
parents who brags, but Henry spoke his first

00:01:06.270 --> 00:01:09.600
multiple-word sentence this week, and it was
very cute. I was like “hi” and he was

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:11.800
like “hi” and I was like “hi” and
he was like “hi” and I was like “hi”

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:14.619
and then he looked me deep in the eyes and
he said “Hi, cat!”

00:01:14.619 --> 00:01:18.031
Part five: Hank, you probably know that Marie
Curie is the only person to win a Nobel Prize

00:01:18.031 --> 00:01:22.829
in both chemistry and physics, but did you
know that her daughter Irene also won a Nobel

00:01:22.829 --> 00:01:26.510
Prize, making her the only Nobel Prize winner
who is the mother of a Nobel Prize winner?

00:01:26.510 --> 00:01:31.299
It’s a fact, Hank! Or is it? Also, Hank,
Marie Curie had a sister named Bronislawa.

00:01:31.299 --> 00:01:35.490
It’s hard out there for a Bronislawa. Hank,
this is off-topic but I will pay you one American

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:38.429
dollar if you write a song about Marie Curie’s
sister called “It’s Hard Out There for

00:01:38.429 --> 00:01:39.429
a Bronislawa.”

00:01:39.429 --> 00:01:42.660
Part six: Hank, you may remember that I purchased
Warner Chilcott stock after Warner Chilcott

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:45.780
Warner Chilcotted you and other people with
ulcerative colitis. Well Hank, I sold that

00:01:45.780 --> 00:01:50.870
stock today for a twenty-six dollar profit!
I’m on a roller coaster that only goes up,

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:54.170
baby! Hank, I don’t think I’ve ever felt
worse about making twenty-six dollars. I’d

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:57.619
like to use that money to decrease Worldsuck,
preferably in a way that Warner Chilcotts

00:01:57.619 --> 00:02:00.340
Warner Chilcott. Nerdfighters, if you have
any ideas, leave them in comments.

00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:03.130
Part seven: Hank, people say my fear of heights
is irrational, but do you know what’s the

00:02:03.130 --> 00:02:08.870
most common cause of non-fatal emergency room
visits between the ages of 25 and 34? Unintentional

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:12.870
fall! And heights are the most common cause
of unintentional falls, meaning that heights

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:17.690
are the greatest non-fatal problem facing
members of our generation! So Hank, let that

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:21.720
be a lesson to you: do not put yourself in
a situation where you could fall unintentionally.

00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:24.590
Part eight: Hank even though you’re like,
successful and grown up and everything, do

00:02:24.590 --> 00:02:28.640
you know that if you Google image search your
name, this is the second result?

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:31.890
So that’s it, seven truths and one lie!
Nerdfighters, leave your guess in comments.

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:36.290
I hope you don’t get fooled! Hank, you’re
a tomato. I’ll see you on Monday.

00:02:36.290 --> 00:02:39.530
P.S. Nerdfighters, if you haven’t seen Hank’s
video about the Ice Cream Chords, your mind

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:44.230
is about to be blown. Click anywhere on the
screen and find out why Rebecca Black and

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:47.060
Slipknot have some surprising things in common.

